msgid "{reason}; retrying"
msgstr "{reason}; yeniden deneniyor"

#: src/daemon.rs:339
msgid "Proton Drive is reachable again, after {duration}"
msgstr "{duration} sonra Proton Drive yeniden erişilebilir"

